This paper forces a complete re-evaluation of what we consider elegant in science,

658
00:47:44,580 --> 00:47:46,080
engineering, and our own cognition.

659
00:47:46,900 --> 00:47:51,020
But I want to leave you, the listener, with a final thought to mull over,

